WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,800
Dahua, I heard that you are working as a slimming model. How much do you pay per day?

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:05,800
Two thousand, four hours of work

3
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:07,800
Two thousand a day is a lot.

4
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:09,800
It’s easy for beauties to make money

5
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:13,000
I work eight hours and have to work overtime, and my monthly salary is less than 10,000 yuan

6
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,800
Modeling is very tiring. After four hours, your bones will fall apart.

7
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,800
Have you ever thought about doing live streaming? You can definitely earn more

8
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:23,600
I don’t like that kind of work, where you have to grab cigarettes, laugh, sing and dance, and show off your coquettishness to please the sponsor.

9
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:25,000
So what do you plan to do in the future?

10
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:26,000
I'm a little confused too

11
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,000
My major is Boeing. If I am looking for a job in my major, I will probably be a secretary or translator.

12
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
It seems that they are all models and the future of this industry is unpredictable because they are eating youth food.

13
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:35,000
What will you do when you get older?

14
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:37,000
It is difficult to be afraid of entering the wrong profession, and a woman is afraid of marrying the wrong man.

15
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:39,000
I think as long as you consider marrying a good man, you will be happy in your life

16
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:42,000
For example, my brother Zhang Tong, who is both civil and military, will definitely be able to rise in the future.

17
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:44,000
For example, I, Luo Ming, must be a charming figure in the future.

18
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:47,000
You mean, let me choose one of you two brothers?

19
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:50,000
That's not what I meant, but it's okay

20
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,000
I'm afraid someone may not be able to like me

21
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:53,000
The photo is real
